==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|bed|time}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|bĕdʹtīm}}, {{IPA|/ˈbɛdtaɪm/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/"bEdtaIm/}}
* {{audio|en-us-bedtime.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[time]] or [[hour]] at which one typically retires to bed in order to sleep.
#: ''I'd love to stay and chat longer, but it's past my '''bedtime''' and I need some rest.''

====Derived terms====
* [[bedtime story]]

